## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path

1. Launch an instance in the challenge.
2. Open the link given after launching an instance in new tab.
3. Run training at five different learning rates to trigger and the model will train based on past data and use slider to slide learning rate.
4. The flag will be displayed beside to graph.



